    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὄγκᾱ</span></b> , ἡ, name of
		Athena at Thebes, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Th.</u>
			164
		</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			487
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			501
		</span></i> : hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀγκαίη</span></b> 
